---
---

<section
	data-testid="research"
	id="research"
	class="flex flex-col items-start justify-center py-20 lg:py-32"
>
	<h2 class="mb-2 font-monospace text-2xl text-orange lg:text-4xl">Research</h2>
	<span class="mb-8 h-1 w-10 bg-orange"></span>

	<p class="mb-10 max-w-2xl text-lg text-black dark:text-white leading-relaxed">
		We conducted <strong>8 semi-structured interviews</strong> with Chinese immigrants living in Seattle
		(1–10 years in the US), recruited from personal networks. Sessions were in-person and via Zoom.
		Participants ranged in age and gender, each living alone or with limited social networks.
	</p>

	<div class="mb-12 w-full">
		<img
			src="/images/palup/affinity_diagram.png"
			alt="Affinity diagram clustering 6 major themes from interview data"
			class="w-full rounded-2xl shadow-lg"
			loading="lazy"
		/>
		<p class="mt-3 text-center text-sm text-black dark:text-white opacity-60">
			Affinity diagram clustering 6 major themes from interview data
		</p>
	</div>

	<div class="mb-12 w-full">
		<img
			src="/images/palup/persona.png"
			alt="User persona — Angela Zhang"
			class="w-full rounded-2xl shadow-lg"
			loading="lazy"
		/>
		<p class="mt-3 text-center text-sm text-black dark:text-white opacity-60">
			User persona: Angela, 28 — Software Engineer, Seattle
		</p>
	</div>

	<h3 class="mb-6 font-monospace text-xl font-bold text-black dark:text-white lg:text-2xl">
		Key Themes
	</h3>
	<div class="grid w-full gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
		<div class="rounded-xl border border-orange/20 bg-white p-6 shadow dark:bg-black">
			<p class="mb-2 font-bold text-orange">Conversation &gt; Cuisine</p>
			<p class="text-sm text-black dark:text-white leading-relaxed">
				Participants consistently prioritized conversational fit over food preferences when evaluating
				potential dining companions.
			</p>
		</div>
		<div class="rounded-xl border border-orange/20 bg-white p-6 shadow dark:bg-black">
			<p class="mb-2 font-bold text-orange">Group Size Matters</p>
			<p class="text-sm text-black dark:text-white leading-relaxed">
				4 people was cited as ideal: small enough to talk meaningfully, large enough to reduce
				awkward silences.
			</p>
		</div>
		<div class="rounded-xl border border-orange/20 bg-white p-6 shadow dark:bg-black">
			<p class="mb-2 font-bold text-orange">Safety Is a Prerequisite</p>
			<p class="text-sm text-black dark:text-white leading-relaxed">
				Especially for female participants, trust mechanisms were non-negotiable — not a bonus
				feature.
			</p>
		</div>
		<div class="rounded-xl border border-orange/20 bg-white p-6 shadow dark:bg-black">
			<p class="mb-2 font-bold text-orange">The Bad Cycle</p>
			<p class="text-sm text-black dark:text-white leading-relaxed">
				Fewer friends → less dining out → harder to meet people. A self-reinforcing loop the app
				needed to break.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
